"<em>Image and album presentation options provided by the Zenphoto core for "
"all themes.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>すべてのテーマにZenphotoコアが提供する画像とアルバムの表示オプション。</"
"em>"

#: zp-core/admin-options/inc-options-theme.php:127
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> These are <em>recommendations</em> as themes may "
